      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09109014084507043,
        "y0": 0.5435172413793103,
        "x1": 0.38217183098591545,
        "y1": 0.553646551724138
      },
      "text": "Deth and synne are bothe oute lopun.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11052394366197182,
        "y0": 0.5552982758620689,
        "x1": 0.4643549295774648,
        "y1": 0.5794258620689655
      },
      "text": "MS. Hail. 1701. f. 70. Theportar set the yatys open.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10971267605633803,
        "y0": 0.5801568965517241,
        "x1": 0.38014366197183097,
        "y1": 0.5916293103448276
      },
      "text": "And with that Befyse ys owt lopon.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.778112676056338,
        "y0": 0.5824724137931034,
        "x1": 0.9161633802816901,
        "y1": 0.5921448275862069
      },
      "text": "; advice. (J.-S.)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11011830985915493,
        "y0": 0.5927413793103449,
        "x1": 0.46273802816901405,
        "y1": 0.6172706896551724
      },
      "text": "MS. Cantab. Ff. ii. 38, f. 108. Anoon was al that feire gederynge",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4846,
        "y0": 0.5946724137931034,
        "x1": 0.8007746478873239,
        "y1": 0.6057
      },
      "text": "(2) Lost. Still in use in Somerset.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5627352112676056,
        "y0": 0.6047931034482759,
        "x1": 0.8457154929577464,
        "y1": 0.6293741379310345
      },
      "text": "The kyng seld. Take me thy tayle. For my hors I wolde not the fayle,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10971267605633803,
        "y0": 0.6190137931034483,
        "x1": 0.3582929577464789,
        "y1": 0.6289086206896551
      },
      "text": "Lopen undir oure lordes wynge.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5619239436619718,
        "y0": 0.6284965517241379,
        "x1": 0.7412760563380282,
        "y1": 0.6415672413793103
      },
      "text": "A peny that thou lore.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10930704225352113,
        "y0": 0.630603448275862,
        "x1": 0.46355211267605634,
        "y1": 0.6655413793103448
      },
      "text": "Cursor Mundi, MS. Coll. Trin. Cantab, f. 111. Sythen he ys lopen on hys stedc. He with hym Harrawde dud lede.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6902619718309859,
        "y0": 0.6422741379310345,
        "x1": 0.9113042253521126,
        "y1": 0.6533586206896551
      },
      "text": "MS. Cantab. Ff. v. 48, f. 61.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4825746478873239,
        "y0": 0.6517758620689655,
        "x1": 0.915349295774648,
        "y1": 0.6674620689655173
      },
      "text": "LOREFADYR. A teacher. Loremastir, Dial.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2364281690140845,
        "y0": 0.6663086206896551,
        "x1": 0.46395211267605635,
        "y1": 0.6769120689655173
      },
      "text": "MS. Cantab. Ff. ii. 38, f. 154.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5052478873239437,
        "y0": 0.6692017241379311,
        "x1": 0.6934957746478874,
        "y1": 0.6801293103448276
      },
      "text": "Great. Moral, p. 243.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.031171830985915496,
        "y0": 0.6763931034482759,
        "x1": 0.4635492957746479,
        "y1": 0.6916413793103449
      },
      "text": "LOPE-STAFF. A leaping-staff. \" A lope-staffe",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5222507042253521,
        "y0": 0.6802913793103449,
        "x1": 0.7469352112676055,
        "y1": 0.6920551724137931
      },
      "text": "Of al men they do most evy].",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.05263098591549296,
        "y0": 0.6912137931034483,
        "x1": 0.4186028169014085,
        "y1": 0.7045758620689655
      },
      "text": "wherewith men leape ditches,\" Cotgrave.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.48176619718309854,
        "y0": 0.693348275862069,
        "x1": 0.9141380281690141,
        "y1": 0.7185068965517242
      },
      "text": "Here lorefadyr ys thedevyl. MS, Harl. 1701, f 24. LOREINE. A rein. See Launfal, 888.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.03076901408450704,
        "y0": 0.7051706896551724,
        "x1": 0.4627408450704225,
        "y1": 0.7184275862068965
      },
      "text": "LOPIRD. Coagulated. Still iu use. See Forby,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5611154929577464,
        "y0": 0.7186206896551725,
        "x1": 0.8295267605633804,
        "y1": 0.7295137931034483
      },
      "text": "Hys loreine lemyd alle with pride,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.05384507042253521,
        "y0": 0.7205637931034483,
        "x1": 0.3218507042253521,
        "y1": 0.7310413793103447
      },
      "text": "Brockett, Grose, Kennett, &c.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5619239436619718,
        "y0": 0.7312603448275863,
        "x1": 0.8169718309859154,
        "y1": 0.7415
      },
      "text": "Stede and armure alle was blake.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07044225352112676,
        "y0": 0.7325827586206897,
        "x1": 0.3582845070422535,
        "y1": 0.7549741379310344
      },
      "text": "Thare he fande none other fode, Bot wlatesome glete and lopird blode",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7437014084507042,
        "y0": 0.7448155172413793,
        "x1": 0.9153521126760563,
        "y1": 0.7537913793103448
      },
      "text": "2lf5:. Har/. 22.52, f. 104.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.48176619718309854,
        "y0": 0.7546103448275863,
        "x1": 0.9076647887323944,
        "y1": 0.7702965517241379
      },
      "text": "LOREL. A bad worthless fellow. {A.-N.)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07003943661971831,
        "y0": 0.7565051724137931,
        "x1": 0.46233521126760563,
        "y1": 0.793051724137931
      },
      "text": "MS. Lincoln A. i. 17, f. 270. Thare dwelled a man in a myrke donjowne. And in a fowlestede of corrupcyowne,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5036281690140846,
        "y0": 0.771798275862069,
        "x1": 0.9145492957746479,
        "y1": 0.7830568965517242
      },
      "text": "Lorels den, Holinshed, Chron. Ireland, p. 93.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5032225352112676,
        "y0": 0.7841172413793103,
        "x1": 0.9149464788732394,
        "y1": 0.8100189655172414
      },
      "text": "Cocke Lorel was formerly a generic title for a very great rascal. \" Lasy lorrels,\" Harman,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07003943661971831,
        "y0": 0.7936844827586207,
        "x1": 0.3724507042253521,
        "y1": 0.8167
      },
      "text": "Whare he had no fode, Bot wlatsome glette and lopyrd blode.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5044366197183098,
        "y0": 0.812505172413793,
        "x1": 0.5522056338028168,
        "y1": 0.8227862068965517
      },
      "text": "1567.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.24816901408450703,
        "y0": 0.8186775862068966,
        "x1": 0.46233521126760563,
        "y1": 0.8290431034482759
      },
      "text": "Hampole, MS. Bowes, p. 25.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4813605633802817,
        "y0": 0.8223431034482759,
        "x1": 0.9129295774647886,
        "y1": 0.8375913793103449
      },
      "text": "LOREMAR. A bit-maker. Palsgrave. \"Lori-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.03076901408450704,
        "y0": 0.8293189655172414,
        "x1": 0.46273802816901405,
        "y1": 0.8432189655172414
      },
      "text": "LOP-LOACH. The leech used by surgeons for",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5032225352112676,
        "y0": 0.8387155172413793,
        "x1": 0.8424845070422535,
        "y1": 0.8501672413793103
      },
      "text": "mers or bit-makers,\" Harrison, p. 97.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.05303380281690141,
        "y0": 0.8449,
        "x1": 0.25627042253521126,
        "y1": 0.8559172413793104
      },
      "text": "drawing blood. North.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4813605633802817,
        "y0": 0.8497689655172413,
        "x1": 0.7441042253521126,
        "y1": 0.864148275862069
      },
      "text": "LORENGE. Iron. {A.-N.)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.03076901408450704,
        "y0": 0.8547189655172414,
        "x1": 0.3595014084507042,
        "y1": 0.870403448275862
      },
      "text": "LOPLOLLY. A lazy fellow. West.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4809549295774648,
        "y0": 0.8636482758620689,
        "x1": 0.8198169014084508,
        "y1": 0.8773741379310345
      },
      "text": "LORER. The laurel-tree. Chaucer.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.031171830985915496,
        "y0": 0.8700931034482758,
        "x1": 0.28865633802816903,
        "y1": 0.8834913793103448
      },
      "text": "LOPPING. Lame. Dorset.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5607098591549295,
        "y0": 0.8775103448275862,
        "x1": 0.7853971830985915,
        "y1": 0.8883310344827586
      },
      "text": "This Daphne into a lorer tre",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.031171830985915496,
        "y0": 0.8836241379310344,
        "x1": 0.46193239436619715,
        "y1": 0.9103862068965517
      },
      "text": "LOP-SIDED. One-sided. Var. dial. LOP-START. The stoat. East. It is men-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5615211267605634,
        "y0": 0.8890448275862068,
        "x1": 0.8299267605633803,
        "y1": 0.9006620689655173
      },
      "text": "Was tumid, whiche is ever grene.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.654230985915493,
        "y0": 0.9013551724137931,
        "x1": 0.9125239436619719,
        "y1": 0.9124396551724138
      },
      "text": "Gower, MS. Soc. Antiq. 134, f. 96.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.05303380281690141,
        "y0": 0.9120655172413793,
        "x1": 0.3874338028169014,
        "y1": 0.9234120689655172
      },
      "text": "tioned in Harrison's England, p. 230.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5412788732394366,
        "y0": 0.914898275862069,
        "x1": 0.8461211267605634,
        "y1": 0.9260827586206897
      },
      "text": "And plaunted trees that were to preise,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.0315774647887324,
        "y0": 0.9230896551724138,
        "x1": 0.2615323943661972,
        "y1": 0.937494827586207
      },
      "text": "LOPUSTER. A lobster.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5412788732394366,
        "y0": 0.9271810344827587,
        "x1": 0.7805464788732395,
        "y1": 0.9378551724137931
      },
      "text": "Of cidre, palmS; and of torere.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.032388732394366196,
        "y0": 0.9358327586206896,
        "x1": 0.39513521126760565,
        "y1": 0.9510810344827586
      },
      "text": "LOPWEBBE. A spider's web. (^.-5-.)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5748788732394366,
        "y0": 0.9394896551724138,
        "x1": 0.9117098591549295,
        "y1": 0.9499465517241379
      },
      "text": "Cursor Mundi, MS. Coll. Trin. Cantab, f.52,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.8355999999999999,
        "y0": 0.9527017241379311,
        "x1": 0.856650704225352,
        "y1": 0.9640293103448276
      },
      "text": "34",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    }
  ],
